From c32e46ff78a02e31b3f518b2d4a9cf16e7992175 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "HT9045 Machine (V906)" <Claude_RDBC_02@honprec.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 17:12:42 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] HTDESIGNER-8: keyboard navigation in the designer, events on
 the hover label (0.8.0)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- design mode, a component selected: Up = parent component, Down = first child,
  Left/Right = previous/next sibling (the same hierarchy as the component tree),
  Enter = open the default event's code, Esc = clear. Only plain keys are taken;
  every modified key (VS Code shortcuts) is left alone
- hover / selection label: "spbSave : TSpeedButton · OnClick   227x40" (events
  from the IR, sent with init)
- the HTML source follows keyboard selection too

Tests: probe keyboard checks on Setup.HotPlate / Setup.Speed (Up -> Panel2,
Down -> spbSave, Right -> sbtExit, Enter -> default event) plus all layers.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 tools/vscode-htdesigner/README.md            |  5 +++
 tools/vscode-htdesigner/extension.js         | 12 +++--
 tools/vscode-htdesigner/media/probe.js       | 46 ++++++++++++++++++--
 tools/vscode-htdesigner/package.json         |  2 +-
 tools/vscode-htdesigner/test/probe_driver.js | 14 ++++++
 5 files changed, 72 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/tools/vscode-htdesigner/README.md b/tools/vscode-htdesigner/README.md
index ff7cf11..3f0c6df 100644
--- a/tools/vscode-htdesigner/README.md
+++ b/tools/vscode-htdesigner/README.md
@@ -42,8 +42,13 @@ code --install-extension tools\vscode-htdesigner\dist\ht9045-html-designer-0.1.0
 | Alt＋點 | 選最內層的 HTML 元素（沒有 id 的也可以） |
 | Ctrl＋點 | 把這一下點擊交給頁面自己處理（例如展開下拉選單） |
 | 點分頁標籤 | 照樣切換分頁 |
+| ↑ ／ ↓ | 選上層元件／第一個子元件（跟元件樹的層次一樣） |
+| ← ／ → | 同一層的前一個／下一個元件 |
+| Enter | 跳到選取元件的預設事件程式碼（同雙擊） |
 | Esc | 取消選取 |
 
+滑鼠移到元件上，標籤會顯示 `名稱 : 型別 · 事件`，例如 `spbSave : TSpeedButton · OnClick   227×40`。
+
 **「元件」樹**：頁面上所有有名字的元件，照 DFM 的層次排列。點一下＝在畫面上選取；
 選到在隱藏分頁裡的元件時，會自動切到那一頁。每一列右邊兩個圖示＝跳到 DFM 定義／跳到 HTML 原始碼。
 
